  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197400",
      "title": "Working with Images & Changing Colors",
      "lectureOrder": 36,
      "videoOrder": 33,
      "sourceHash": "6ebd239c4fbe3cfb9945229ee30b832aa4a76b32dbcbac5bb1cdae6365887f9e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 4.79,
          "en": "Now to finally finish this app here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.79,
          "end": 7.59,
          "en": "I wanna improve the overall look and feel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.59,
          "end": 11.06,
          "en": "by changing some colors and by adding an image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.06,
          "end": 13.48,
          "en": "Which is something we haven't done yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.48,
          "end": 15.71,
          "en": "But which is of course, something you will often do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.71,
          "end": 17.71,
          "en": "And you should therefore know how to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.79,
          "end": 21.17,
          "en": "Now, adding an image, thankfully is easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.17,
          "end": 23.603,
          "en": "Because React Native has a component for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.78,
          "end": 27.12,
          "en": "There is an \"image\" component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.12,
          "end": 29.533,
          "en": "which you can import from React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.44,
          "end": 31.84,
          "en": "And just as you have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.84,
          "end": 35.59,
          "en": "the \"image\" element for the web, in HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.59,
          "end": 39.263,
          "en": "This is a component that helps with displaying an image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.64,
          "end": 43.42,
          "en": "This \"image\" component is used in your JSX Code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.42,
          "end": 45.41,
          "en": "And here I wanna display an image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.41,
          "end": 47.083,
          "en": "right above the text input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.36,
          "end": 50.023,
          "en": "So, I will add my image here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.09,
          "end": 54.21,
          "en": "On this image, you can then add some style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.21,
          "end": 55.77,
          "en": "Which we'll do in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.77,
          "end": 59.523,
          "en": "But most importantly, you can also add a \"source\" prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.45,
          "end": 63.31,
          "en": "And this should point at the image you want to add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.31,
          "end": 65.2,
          "en": "Now, when it comes to that image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.2,
          "end": 68.223,
          "en": "you do find an example image attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.2,
          "end": 71.55,
          "en": "And you should download that image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.55,
          "end": 74.37,
          "en": "and move it into your \"assets\" folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.37,
          "end": 77.76,
          "en": "Or to be precise create an \"images\" folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.76,
          "end": 79.84,
          "en": "in that \"assets\" folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.84,
          "end": 82.03999999999999,
          "en": "Because that \"assets\" folder is generally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.03999999999999,
          "end": 86.76,
          "en": "the folder where static assets like images should be stored.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.76,
          "end": 89.06,
          "en": "And then move that attached image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.06,
          "end": 92.42,
          "en": "into that \"images\" folder in the \"assets\" folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.42,
          "end": 95.563,
          "en": "And it's this \"goal image\", which you got attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.06,
          "end": 100.41,
          "en": "And now when it comes to linking to that image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.41,
          "end": 104.34,
          "en": "It works differently than what you're used to from the web.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.34,
          "end": 108.987,
          "en": "We won't create some link here, which points to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.987,
          "end": 112.75,
          "en": "\"assets/images/goal.png\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.75,
          "end": 115.09,
          "en": "at least not quite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.09,
          "end": 118.6,
          "en": "It's not too wrong, but it wouldn't work like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.6,
          "end": 122.48,
          "en": "If I save this, you see, I get a warning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.48,
          "end": 124.333,
          "en": "I get an error, this doesn't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.76,
          "end": 128.62,
          "en": "Instead, you have to import the image here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.62,
          "end": 131.003,
          "en": "with a special import syntax.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.23,
          "end": 134.93,
          "en": "You should use a \"require\" function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.93,
          "end": 137.15,
          "en": "Which you might know from Node.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.15,
          "end": 138.363,
          "en": "if you worked with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.26,
          "end": 141.13,
          "en": "And to that \"require\" function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.13,
          "end": 144.02,
          "en": "you pass the path to the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.02,
          "end": 148.29,
          "en": "However, the path is a relative path from the file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.29,
          "end": 150.59,
          "en": "in which you're using this \"require\" function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.59,
          "end": 154.82,
          "en": "So, seen relatively from that goal input file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.82,
          "end": 156.23,
          "en": "which is that file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.23,
          "end": 158.57999999999998,
          "en": "where this \"required\" function gets used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.57999999999998,
          "end": 160.8,
          "en": "We have to go up one level,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.8,
          "end": 162.763,
          "en": "to leave the \"components\" folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.84,
          "end": 166.53300000000002,
          "en": "And then dive into images and select the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.39,
          "end": 171.762,
          "en": "Now to go up one level we type ../,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.762,
          "end": 173.863,
          "en": "this means go to the parent folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.7,
          "end": 179.09,
          "en": "And then we dive into assets, images, goal.png.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.09,
          "end": 180.763,
          "en": "This is how we add an image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.78,
          "end": 184.45,
          "en": "Now let's also add some styling to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.45,
          "end": 187.84,
          "en": "And for this, I'll add an \"image styling\" object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.84,
          "end": 189.98,
          "en": "in my style sheet here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.98,
          "end": 193.5,
          "en": "And here we could set a width of let's say 100 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.5,
          "end": 196.03300000000002,
          "en": "And a height of 100 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.32999999999998,
          "end": 200.45,
          "en": "And give this a margin of 20 in all directions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.45,
          "end": 202.82,
          "en": "to have some spacing around the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.82,
          "end": 204.54,
          "en": "As always, you can play around with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.54,
          "end": 207.113,
          "en": "the styling, to find your favorite styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.16,
          "end": 210.95,
          "en": "Now I wanna apply that style to my image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.95,
          "end": 213.38,
          "en": "And thankfully the \"image\" element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.38,
          "end": 217.67000000000002,
          "en": "the \"image\" Component, does support the style prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 217.67000000000002,
          "end": 220.04,
          "en": "And we can set \"styles.image\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 220.04,
          "end": 222.073,
          "en": "as a value on that style prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.29,
          "end": 227.36,
          "en": "And with that, if we reload the app by pressing R here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.36,
          "end": 228.79,
          "en": "in the terminal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.79,
          "end": 231.81,
          "en": "You will see nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.81,
          "end": 233.44,
          "en": "As it seems.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.44,
          "end": 236.11,
          "en": "The reason for that is that the image is white.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 236.11,
          "end": 237.49,
          "en": "And we can't see that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 237.49,
          "end": 239.95,
          "en": "because the background is also white.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 239.95,
          "end": 241.35,
          "en": "That's no problem because,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 241.35,
          "end": 244.12,
          "en": "I wanted to changed the background as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 244.12,
          "end": 245.81,
          "en": "And since we're in the modal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 245.81,
          "end": 247.88,
          "en": "This background can be changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 247.88,
          "end": 251.09,
          "en": "By setting a different background on this input container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 251.09,
          "end": 253.76,
          "en": "Because that is our root element in the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 253.76,
          "end": 257.313,
          "en": "And it defines the overall modal container look therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 258.32,
          "end": 261.14,
          "en": "The modal itself does support the style prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 261.14,
          "end": 264.08,
          "en": "But for styling the overall modal background,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 264.08,
          "end": 267.483,
          "en": "you should use a nested view, as we are doing it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 269.11,
          "end": 271.96,
          "en": "And now here on this input container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 271.96,
          "end": 275.863,
          "en": "We can add a background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 277.59000000000003,
          "end": 279.96,
          "en": "And I prepared a nice dark purple,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 279.96,
          "end": 281.40999999999997,
          "en": "which I'd like to use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 281.40999999999997,
          "end": 285.513,
          "en": "Which has to hex code 311b6b.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 286.95,
          "end": 287.86,
          "en": "And whilst we're here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 287.86,
          "end": 289.68,
          "en": "I also wanna change some other styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 289.68,
          "end": 291.5,
          "en": "For example, we don't need the border",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 291.5,
          "end": 292.85,
          "en": "at the bottom anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 292.85,
          "end": 295.18,
          "en": "Because there is nothing below that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 295.18,
          "end": 298.67,
          "en": "And that border here looks really strange.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 298.67,
          "end": 300.91,
          "en": "So I will remove that border.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 300.91,
          "end": 305.91,
          "en": "And I will also remove that margin to the bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 306.53,
          "end": 307.543,
          "en": "which I have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 308.9,
          "end": 312.4,
          "en": "So that these are the remaining styles that I have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 312.4,
          "end": 314.41,
          "en": "And with this, now we can see the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 314.41,
          "end": 317.483,
          "en": "Because now we got this nice purple background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 318.77,
          "end": 320.26,
          "en": "Only in the modal though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 320.26,
          "end": 322.72,
          "en": "We will work on the other background later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 322.72,
          "end": 325.27,
          "en": "But here in the model, we got that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 325.27,
          "end": 328.09,
          "en": "Of course, we now also might want to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 328.09,
          "end": 330.57,
          "en": "tweak the text color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 330.57,
          "end": 333.28,
          "en": "When we enter something into this input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 333.28,
          "end": 336.79,
          "en": "And we might wanna tweak the buttons here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 336.79,
          "end": 339.11,
          "en": "To make those look a bit prettier as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 339.11,
          "end": 342.33,
          "en": "Because currently they don't fit the background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 342.33,
          "end": 345.24,
          "en": "But most importantly, we did now add the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 345.24,
          "end": 347.65999999999997,
          "en": "Which was the main task for this lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 347.65999999999997,
          "end": 350.8,
          "en": "And as you saw, adding an image is super simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 350.8,
          "end": 354.903,
          "en": "With that \"image\" Component and this way of adding a source.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 355.85,
          "end": 358.34000000000003,
          "en": "So let's next improve the overall styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 358.34000000000003,
          "end": 360.23,
          "en": "of those modal elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 360.23,
          "end": 362.363,
          "en": "The other elements, I mean.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
